abstract: "Official implementation of Causal Transparency Algebra (ℝ_∅) and the ∅-Net architecture: a non-distributive bi-identity algebraic framework enabling zero-power neuromorphic hardware bypasses, drift-free continual learning, fault-tolerant multimodal fusion, and native epistemic abstention."
